@@ -2,6 +2,17 @@
 
 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
 
+## Agent tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up forms expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` through the
+[WebMCP declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api)
+in supporting browsers. Each tool is available on its corresponding page after
+React hydrates, accepts required `username` and `password` fields, and submits
+through the same client-side handler as the visible form. The tool waits for the
+request and returns `{ success, message }`, including API and network failures.
+Credentials and response tokens are not included in tool results. Other browsers
+continue to use the forms normally.
+
 
 ```sh
 pnpm install && pnpm run start
